      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115L020.                                             00050005
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Module which will generate a new contract no, based upon        00070005
      * the contract type                                               00070006
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary call may look like this:                            00210001
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115L020-Gen-Contract-No 00230005
      *    Set   R115L020-Version        To    True                     00240005
      *    Set   R115L020-In-Select      To    True                     00250005
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115L020-In-Contract-Type00270007
      *                                                                 00290000
      *    Call  'F115L020'              Using R115L020-Gen-Contract-No 00300005
      *                                        R7919999-Error           00310000
      *    End-Call                                                     00320000
      *                                                                 00330000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00340000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  00350000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00360000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00370000
      *                                                                 00380000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   00390000
      *        ...not found...                                          00400000
      *                                                                 00410000
      *      When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     00420000
      *        ...found...                                              00430000
      *                                                                 00440000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00450000
      *                                                                 00460000
      *################################################################*00470000
